        10("<div style='font-weight: bold'>CQRS Unit of Work</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: Custom .NET command and query handlers]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Owns IDE application logic.<br />Dispatches typed commands and<br />read-only queries to<br />registered handlers with<br />scoped context, validates<br />eligibility, and returns or<br />publishes their outcomes.</div>")
        style 10 fill:#275c60,stroke:#4eb9aa,color:#ffffff
        26("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Session Coordinator</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: .NET EmulatorSessionCoordinator and PinnedEmulatorSession]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Negotiates the installed<br />binding's contract, validates<br />the opened session identity<br />and close policy, and<br />transfers the package lease<br />to the pinned session.<br />Fixture adapters verify<br />launch, attach, reconnect,<br />and release.</div>")
        style 26 fill:#24557b,stroke:#74a9d0,color:#ffffff
        27("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Typed Session Control</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: .NET EmulatorSessionControl]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Checks captured identity,<br />grants, capabilities,<br />revisions, and payloads<br />before routing to advertised<br />ports. Correlates exact<br />retries, operation receipts,<br />and uncertain outcomes.</div>")
        style 27 fill:#24557b,stroke:#74a9d0,color:#ffffff
        28("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Session Subscriptions</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: .NET EmulatorSubscriptions and BufferedEmulatorMedia]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Reserves provider<br />subscriptions, tracks ordered<br />control cursors and gaps, and<br />buffers media independently.<br />Drains pending and paused<br />subscriptions before the<br />provider connection closes.</div>")
        style 28 fill:#24557b,stroke:#74a9d0,color:#ffffff
        29("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Machine Descriptor and Memory Map</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: .NET IMachineDescriptorPort and MachineMap]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Validates the session's<br />descriptor schema, CPU and<br />address spaces. Watches<br />ordered map revisions,<br />rechecks current capability<br />and map scope before mapped<br />operations, and retains<br />independently advertised raw<br />inspection.</div>")
        style 29 fill:#24557b,stroke:#74a9d0,color:#ffffff
        30("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Verified Package Profiles</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: .NET declarative profile validation]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Checks each declared debugger<br />profile's reference, schema,<br />path, and digest. Projects<br />available profile references<br />into project selection and<br />resolves the active<br />descriptor's reference under<br />its pinned package lease.</div>")
        style 30 fill:#24557b,stroke:#74a9d0,color:#ffffff
        38("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Retro IDE MCP Host</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: Official MCP C# SDK, Microsoft.Extensions.Hosting, ASP.NET Core]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Exposes registered IDE tools<br />through the shared CQRS<br />dispatcher. Generates schemas<br />from public ViewModel<br />contracts, verifies live<br />context and grants, and<br />returns scoped operation<br />handles for supported<br />background calls including<br />package refresh.</div>")
        style 38 fill:#24557b,stroke:#74a9d0,color:#ffffff
        39("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Scoped Background Operations</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: .NET WorkbenchOperations]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Tracks accepted and running<br />work, cancellation, and typed<br />success or failure. Checks<br />the original actor grant<br />before reading, cancelling,<br />or returning an operation<br />result.</div>")
        style 39 fill:#235c49,stroke:#62aa88,color:#ffffff
        40("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Emulators Management View</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: Avalonia EmulatorsPane and EmulatorsViewModel]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Browses buckets, compatible<br />releases, and installed<br />versions. Shows project<br />version history, binding<br />readiness, and verified<br />profiles. Refreshes after UI<br />or MCP changes and discards<br />results for superseded<br />project selections.</div>")
        style 40 fill:#24557b,stroke:#74a9d0,color:#ffffff
        41("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Emulator Bundle Manager</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: .NET EmulatorWorkspace, Git, JSON, SHA-256]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Reads Git bucket manifests at<br />a recorded commit, selects a<br />compatible host target,<br />verifies archives and entry<br />points, and publishes<br />immutable versions with<br />receipts. Persists project<br />pins and rollback history.</div>")
        style 41 fill:#24557b,stroke:#74a9d0,color:#ffffff
        42("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Pinned Adapter Resolver</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: .NET EmulatorWorkspace and EmulatorBundleStore]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Resolves the project's<br />selected installed bundle for<br />the host and contract<br />version. Checks the<br />installation receipt and<br />binding entry point, exposes<br />verified profile references,<br />and supplies a lease for<br />session open.</div>")
        style 42 fill:#24557b,stroke:#74a9d0,color:#ffffff
        8("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Main MVC Controller</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: GPS.SimpleMVC 2.0.0]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Owns dispatch and result<br />delivery for views registered<br />directly with it. Provides<br />the shared execution entry<br />point for typed requests from<br />all controllers into the<br />custom Unit of Work.</div>")
        style 8 fill:#275c60,stroke:#4eb9aa,color:#ffffff
